      },
      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A giant with skin of black volcanic glass, lava glowing through the cracks in its chest and arms. A small volcano on its back belches smoke and cinders. It carries a huge obsidian warhammer, its edges glowing red-hot. Its face is broad and cruel, its eyes like molten metal.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.wHeJAYszJH8N6zBw]{20. The Burning Giant}.</strong> Lerritan burning toward Kettle Hollow in the name of its fire demigod. Opens with Volcanic Eruption; fights to the death. Apply the elite adjustment at party level 19.</p>"
    },
